on mouseUp
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [  4] pushint16 100 ........................... <100>
  [  7] ontospr ................................. <sprite the clickOn intersects 100>
  [  8] jmpifz [ 71] ............................ if sprite the clickOn intersects 100 then
  [ 11] pushint16 100 ........................... <100>
  [ 14] pushcons 0 .............................. <"piphead2">
  [ 16] pushcons 1 .............................. <"master">
  [ 18] pushint16 10 ............................ <10>
  [ 21] get 9 ................................... <the number of member "piphead2" of castLib "master">
  [ 23] pushint16 35 ............................ <35>
  [ 26] set 6 ................................... set the memberNum of sprite 100 to the number of member "piphead2" of castLib "master"
  [ 28] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 30] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 32] pushint16 35 ............................ <35>
  [ 35] get 6 ................................... <the memberNum of sprite the clickOn>
  [ 37] setlocal 0 .............................. x = the memberNum of sprite the clickOn
  [ 39] getlocal 0 .............................. <x>
  [ 41] pushcons 2 .............................. <"master">
  [ 43] pusharglist 2 ........................... <x, "master">
  [ 45] extcall 22 .............................. <member(x, "master")>
  [ 47] getobjprop 30 ........................... <member(x, "master").name>
  [ 49] setlocal 0 .............................. x = member(x, "master").name
  [ 51] pushsymb 11 ............................. <#playFile>
  [ 53] pushint16 1 ............................. <1>
  [ 56] getglobal 13 ............................ <soundspath>
  [ 58] pushcons 3 .............................. <"pi">
  [ 60] getlocal 0 .............................. <x>
  [ 62] joinstr ................................. <"pi" & x>
  [ 63] pushcons 4 .............................. <".aif">
  [ 65] joinstr ................................. <"pi" & x & ".aif">
  [ 66] joinstr ................................. <soundspath & "pi" & x & ".aif">
  [ 67] pusharglistnoret 3 ...................... <1, soundspath & "pi" & x & ".aif">
  [ 69] extcall 12 .............................. sound playFile 1, soundspath & "pi" & x & ".aif"
  [ 71] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 73] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 75] getglobal 32 ............................ <objectxx>
  [ 78] pushint16 13 ............................ <13>
  [ 81] set 6 ................................... set the locH of sprite the clickOn to objectxx
  [ 83] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 85] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 87] getglobal 33 ............................ <objectyy>
  [ 90] pushint16 14 ............................ <14>
  [ 93] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite the clickOn to objectyy
  [ 95] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 97] extcall 34 .............................. updateStage()
  [100] pushint16 100 ........................... <100>
  [103] pushcons 5 .............................. <"piphead1">
  [105] pushcons 6 .............................. <"master">
  [107] pushint16 10 ............................ <10>
  [110] get 9 ................................... <the number of member "piphead1" of castLib "master">
  [112] pushint16 35 ............................ <35>
  [115] set 6 ................................... set the memberNum of sprite 100 to the number of member "piphead1" of castLib "master"
  [117] ret
end

on mouseDown
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [  4] pushint16 13 ............................ <13>
  [  7] get 6 ................................... <the locH of sprite the clickOn>
  [  9] setglobal 32 ............................ objectxx = the locH of sprite the clickOn
  [ 12] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 14] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 16] pushint16 14 ............................ <14>
  [ 19] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite the clickOn>
  [ 21] setglobal 33 ............................ objectyy = the locV of sprite the clickOn
  [ 24] ret
end
